Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK49 Revival
Map Version	1.0.0

// MPK49 Revival — Reason 14 Remote Map
// Works with presets/reason14_rack.json (Slot 03) + AkaiMPK49_Revival.lua codec.
//
// CC map (Bank A, Channel 1):
//   Knob 1-4:   CC 2-5   → Combinator Rotary 1-4
//   Knob 5-8:   CC 6-9   → Synth filter/reso/pan/level (context-dependent)
//   Fader 1-8:  CC 12-19 → Mixer 14:2 Channel 1-8 Level
//   Switch 1-4: CC 21-24 → Combinator Button 1-4 (Toggle)
//   Switch 5-6: CC 25-26 → Mixer 14:2 Channel 1-2 Mute (Toggle)
//   Switch 7:   CC 27    → Punch In (Momentary)
//   Switch 8:   CC 28    → Tap Tempo (Momentary)
//   Transport:  MMC SysEx → Play / Stop / Record / Rewind / Fast Forward


// ── Master Keyboard ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Scope	Propellerheads	Master Keyboard
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard
Map	Pitch Bend		Pitch Bend
Map	Mod Wheel		Mod Wheel
Map	Channel Pressure		Channel Pressure
Map	Expression		Expression
Map	Damper Pedal		Damper Pedal


// ── Reason Document (Transport) ───────────────────────────────────────────────

Scope	Propellerheads	Reason Document
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item
Map	Play		Play
Map	Stop		Stop
Map	Record		Record
Map	Rewind		Rewind
Map	Fast Forward		Fast Forward
Map	Switch 8		Tap Tempo


// ── Combinator ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Scope	Propellerheads	Combinator
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item
Map	Knob 1		Rotary 1
Map	Knob 2		Rotary 2
Map	Knob 3		Rotary 3
Map	Knob 4		Rotary 4
Map	Switch 1		Button 1
Map	Switch 2		Button 2
Map	Switch 3		Button 3
Map	Switch 4		Button 4


// ── Mixer 14:2 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Scope	Propellerheads	Mixer 14:2
Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Levels	Mutes
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	Fader 1		Channel 1 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 2		Channel 2 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 3		Channel 3 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 4		Channel 4 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 5		Channel 5 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 6		Channel 6 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 7		Channel 7 Level		Levels
Map	Fader 8		Channel 8 Level		Levels

Map	Switch 5		Channel 1 Mute		Mutes
Map	Switch 6		Channel 2 Mute		Mutes


// ── Kong Drum Designer ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Note: Kong drum pads (Drum 1-12) are triggered directly via MIDI notes
// from the MPK49 pads — no Remote mapping needed for note triggers.
// The faders below control drum channel levels via Remote.

Scope	Propellerheads	Kong Drum Designer
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item
Map	Fader 1		Drum 1 Level
Map	Fader 2		Drum 2 Level
Map	Fader 3		Drum 3 Level
Map	Fader 4		Drum 4 Level
Map	Fader 5		Drum 5 Level
Map	Fader 6		Drum 6 Level
Map	Fader 7		Drum 7 Level
Map	Fader 8		Drum 8 Level
Map	Knob 1		Drum 1 Pitch Offset
Map	Knob 2		Drum 2 Pitch Offset
Map	Knob 3		Drum 3 Pitch Offset
Map	Knob 4		Drum 4 Pitch Offset


